{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-08-06 12:00:00', 'title': 'VERIZON CFO MATT ELLIS TO SPEAK AT OPPENHEIMER CONFERENCE AUGUST 9', 'text': "BASKING RIDGE, N.J., AUG. 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MATT ELLIS, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER FOR VERIZON COMMUNICATIONS INC. (NYSE, NASDAQ: VZ), IS SCHEDULED TO SPEAK AT THE VIRTUAL OPPENHEIMER 24TH ANNUAL TECHNOLOGY, INTERNET & COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, AUGUST 9, AT 12:25 P.M. ET. HIS REMARKS WILL BE WEBCAST, WITH ACCESS INSTRUCTIONS AVAILABLE ON VERIZON'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE, WWW.VERIZON.COM/ABOUT/INVESTORS/."}